{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:5.60.010","page_type":"section"},"citation":"5.60.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","content_hash":"043d3d5f5ad74e36feb066f2f92e53904382d5ed1cb052a1300ac372dcee2257","heading":"City temporary permit.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to conduct an event under a State-issued temporary permit without first applying for a local temporary permit at least seven days before the event. Written application for the local temporary permit shall be made to the City Clerk and shall clearly state:\n(1) Name of the applicant;\n(2) The group for which the event is planned;\n(3) The location of the event;\n(4) The date and time of the event;\n(5) Any anticipated need for police, fire or other municipal services.\n(b) Upon presentation of a State temporary permit, payment of the temporary permit fee, not to exceed $25.00, as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule and a written application as provided for in subsection (a) of this section, the City Clerk shall issue a local temporary permit to the applicant if there are no conflicts with any zoning or other ordinances of the City. (Ord. 20631 § 7, 1-13-26.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"8025d793-c7a9-541e-9b59-89e41f681a70"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.60.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","content_hash":"3f2ee546fc8a3394e7dc11a60dbb00fe2d68930f157e450cef461997f17e6fb7","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to conduct an event under a State-issued temporary permit without first applying for a local temporary permit at least seven days before the event. Written application for the local temporary permit shall be made to the City Clerk and shall clearly state:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b5fc5165-ebd0-5673-b6e2-2f93a6249b02"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.60.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","content_hash":"a0774d9efa213ffa09beb665f3aaf7fb2fd941915e4dfd1c0b5aa8fd58ac15f4","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","text":"(1) Name of the applicant;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"18801f86-99d8-5bce-9dee-4700339be7c7"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.60.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","content_hash":"691ba9eb36de767387ab33a376b97a3fd258b340f59f4c67b752c46998f009aa","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","text":"(2) The group for which the event is planned;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"dce2c0f6-b80e-533b-b77a-7c797b95e25c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.60.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","content_hash":"dd497d3249d963b05b63e481aecbfd9000a4fe7e5f8cfa33d880849f0588bbe0","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","text":"(3) The location of the event;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"dfc5bfdc-441a-5ab2-b0c8-8abd0bcc9041"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.60.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","content_hash":"2ef69e9d7fe49089e7d744f9edb641ab56d87a2cb0c1d47155cae5fadbf809c2","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","text":"(4) The date and time of the event;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"faf33c9b-96f6-552d-b10b-86c1ef89b740"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.60.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","content_hash":"06e2b8a533fe910422417f55a5838f86b1dbdaf08656ef6710703fba6203a1f5","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","text":"(5) Any anticipated need for police, fire or other municipal services.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b5d95467-4106-562a-8a0a-91c1369594dd"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.60.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.60.010","content_hash":"4fcb72d4dd97637905c2da424fbf1dac3f5da4c3cf1d5a9e373c46a762050b0f","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.60.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_